0..76 Comment "// Rose trees: a node holds a forest of children, and a forest is empty or a"
77..151 Comment "// tree before a forest. The two families name each other, so they are one"
152..226 Comment "// block, admitted as one and sharing one stage; and the two measures name"
227..302 Comment "// each other, so they are one fixpoint over the sum of their domains, each"
303..380 Comment "// measure that fixpoint at its own summand. A call through either stands one"
381..457 Comment "// stage below the node or forest it was read from. #393 is where the direct"
458..535 Comment "// form, the children a `List(Rose)` kept and typed by stage, supersedes this"
536..574 Comment "// block and the example is revisited."
